sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Caregiver
    participant UI as ObserverHub (Blazor WASM)
    participant W as Inference Web Worker
    participant API as Minimal API /api/observer
    participant SVC as ObservationService
    participant T as Table Storage
    participant BL as Blob Storage

    U->>UI: Start monitoring
    UI->>W: captureAndInfer(prompt, frame, maxTokens)
    W-->>UI: activity, clinicalPayload, confidence, subjectHint

    alt frame unchanged or low-quality output
        UI-->>U: cycle skipped, no request sent
    else usable inference
        UI->>API: POST /api/observer/ingest (cookie)
        API->>SVC: IngestAsync(request)
        SVC->>SVC: flag gate, concurrency gate, sanitizer
        SVC->>SVC: resolve subject, classify significance
        SVC->>T: write observation row
        SVC->>T: merge subject last-activity
        API-->>UI: 200 Ok / 202 Accepted (dropped)
    end

    opt result is significant
        UI->>API: GET /api/blobs/sas?blobPath=...&upload=true
        API-->>UI: SAS url (30 min)
        UI->>BL: PUT jpeg direct to blob
    end

    UI-->>U: timeline, alert banner, audio cue
